# PostHog wizard scaffolding — vendor-generated, not app code.
# .claude/agents and .claude/commands stay tracked; only skills/ is ignored.
# Force-add (git add -f) if you ever author a skill you want in the repo.
.claude/skills/
posthog-self-driving-report.md

# Supabase CLI scratch. `supabase/config.toml` and `supabase/functions/` and
# `supabase/migrations/` are the repo's real content; .temp/ is a version
# marker the CLI rewrites on every run and offers up as a change each time.
supabase/.temp/
.setlistfm-cache/
setlistfm-derived.json
report.json

# Files Claude saves beside the project (Instagram slides, preview sheets).
